                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty fun for what it is, but it's been abandoned and is very incomplete. There just isn't that much content here; a couple bosses and not much progression in level design or interesting enemies. The gameplay is a blast but there are definitely balance issues (homesick shard can softlock you and force you to fly into the death ceiling, for one thing). I'd love to see it finished! Maybe there's modding potential, I dunno. But if you need mods to make a game worth the price then it's not worth the price. Music and artstyle is nice tho.",
